//dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/about/studio-policies/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-468\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Studio Policies\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/about/teachers/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-469\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Teachers\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\u003c/details>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/schedule/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-470\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Schedule\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003cdetails class=\"mobile-menu-group\">\u003csummary>\u003cspan data-cms-control-label=\"\" data-cms-target=\"cms-480\">Shows &amp; Competition\u003c/span>\u003c/summary>\u003cdiv class=\"mobile-submenu\">\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/shows-and-competition/nutcracker/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-471\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Nutcracker\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/shows-and-competition/competition/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-472\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Competition\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/shows-and-competition/recital/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-473\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Recital\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\u003c/details>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/summer-intensive/index.html\" aria-current=\"page\" data-cms-target=\"cms-474\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Summer Intensive\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/contact/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-475\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Contact\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/register/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-476\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Register\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca class=\"mobile-phone\" href=\"tel:+13035250011\" data-cms-target=\"cms-435\">303-525-0011\u003c/a>\u003c/nav>\n\u003cmain id=\"main\">\u003cdiv class=\"summer-page\">\u003cheader class=\"page-intro section-shell\">\u003ch1 class=\"intro-title\" data-cms-target=\"cms-440\">2025 Summer Schedule\u003c/h1>\u003c/header>\n\u003csection class=\"section-shell summer-intensive\" data-cms-target=\"cms-490\">\u003cdiv class=\"summer-heading\">\u003ch2 data-cms-target=\"cms-441\">Summer Intensive\u003c/h2>\u003cp class=\"summer-intensive-dates\">\u003cspan data-cms-target=\"cms-442\">Classes meet Tuesdays, Wednesdays and Thursdays from June 17th–July 31st.\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"summer-date-exception\" data-cms-target=\"cms-443\">No class the week of July 4th.\u003c/span>\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-courses\" data-cms-target=\"cms-452\">\u003carticle class=\"summer-course\">\u003ch3>Contemporary/Jazz\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-course-meta\">\u003cp class=\"summer-time\">2:00-3:30\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-price\">$225.00\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"summer-course\">\u003ch3>Inter/Adv Ballet\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-course-meta\">\u003cp class=\"summer-time\">3:30-5:00\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-price\">$225.00\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cp class=\"summer-course-note\">(This is for both Pointe and non-Pointe Ballet dancers.)\u003c/p>\u003c/article>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-combined\">\u003cp class=\"summer-both\" data-cms-target=\"cms-444\">\u003cstrong>$400.00\u003c/strong> for both courses.\u003c/p>\u003cp data-cms-target=\"cms-445\">Your dancer will have 54 hours of training this summer with our intensive. Our Intensive is perfect for dancers 11 and older that are looking to not only maintain their dance over the summer but to grow and be challenged.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cp class=\"summer-flexibility\" data-cms-target=\"cms-446\">We understand there are vacations planned and students will miss some days here and there. This intensive is designed to accommodate busy schedules with an open curriculum and an extremely discounted price. As well as, no Monday or Friday classes.\u003c/p>\u003c/section>\n\u003csection class=\"section-shell summer-camps\" data-cms-target=\"cms-491\">\u003cdiv class=\"summer-heading\">\u003ch2 data-cms-target=\"cms-447\">Summer Camps\u003c/h2>\u003cp data-cms-target=\"cms-448\">Schedule is subject to change or cancellation. Sign-up early to get the week you want.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-list\" data-cms-target=\"cms-453\">\u003carticle class=\"summer-camp\">\u003ch3>\u003cspan>Camp AGES 4-6 years old\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"summer-camp-price\">\u003cspan class=\"summer-price-separator\"> - \u003c/span>$225.00\u003c/span>\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-details\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-dates\">June 16th – 20th or July 14th – July 18th\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-time\">9:30 AM - 12:00 PM\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-body\">This camp includes Tap, Ballet, Tumbling, Crafts, Snack.\u003c/p>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-notes\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"summer-camp\">\u003ch3>\u003cspan>Camp AGES 6-9 years old\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"summer-camp-price\">\u003cspan class=\"summer-price-separator\"> - \u003c/span>$225.00\u003c/span>\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-details\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-dates\">June 23rd – 27th or July 21st - July 25th\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-time\">9:30 AM - 12:00 PM\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-body\">This camp includes Tap, Ballet, Tumbling, Hip-Hop, Video, Snack.\u003c/p>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-notes\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-note\">(Parents of 8 &amp; 9-year-old students please see Miss Michele for placement)\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"summer-camp\">\u003ch3>\u003cspan>Afternoon Art 6-9 years old\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"summer-camp-price\">\u003cspan class=\"summer-price-separator\"> - \u003c/span>$225.00\u003c/span>\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-details\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-dates\">June 23rd – 27th or July 21st - July 25th\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-time\">1:00 PM - 3:30 PM\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-body\">Make it an all-day camp for your dancer by adding art in the afternoons. Pack a lunch and spend the afternoon relaxing with our wonderful array of art projects. Each day is a different theme.\u003c/p>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-notes\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-discount\">(There’s a $25 discount when combined with morning Dance Camp)\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"summer-camp\">\u003ch3>\u003cspan>Hip-Hop Camp Ages 6 and up\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"summer-camp-price\">\u003cspan class=\"summer-price-separator\"> - \u003c/span>$195.00\u003c/span>\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-details\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-dates\">July 28th – Aug 1st\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-time\">10:00 AM - Noon\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-body\">Students will receive training from Miss Irie and guest instructors. This camp is designed to give dancers the flavor of Hip-Hop, including breaking, freestyle, and choreography. Snack included.\u003c/p>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-notes\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"summer-camp\">\u003ch3>\u003cspan>Camp AGES 8 – 13 (Beginner/Intermediate)\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"summer-camp-price\">\u003cspan class=\"summer-price-separator\"> - \u003c/span>$250.00\u003c/span>\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-details\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-dates\">July 28th – Aug 1st\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-time\">1:00 PM - 4:30 PM\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-body\">This camp is designed to quickly elevate a student’s abilities. The focus will be on Technique, Showmanship, Strength, and Flexibility in Ballet, Lyrical, Tap, and Jazz. Snack included.\u003c/p>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-notes\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-discount\">(There’s a $25 discount when combined with Hip-Hop)\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-note\">(Parents of 8 &amp;; 9-year-old students please see Miss Michele for placement)\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003carticle class=\"summer-camp\">\u003ch3>\u003cspan>Nutcracker Prep Week\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"summer-camp-price\">\u003cspan class=\"summer-price-separator\"> - \u003c/span>$100.00\u003c/span>\u003c/h3>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-details\">\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-dates\">Aug 18th – Aug 22nd\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-time\">5:00 PM - 7:00 PM (Monday – Thursday)\u003c/p>\u003cp class=\"summer-camp-body\">This week prepares dancers for their Nutcracker audition. Any dancer wanting to put extra focus into their ballet dancing before they audition is encouraged to come dance with us this week.\u003c/p>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-notes\">\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\u003c/article>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"summer-camp-info\">\u003cp data-cms-target=\"cms-449\">Full-day camp is available by combining morning and afternoon camps. Early drop-off and Late pick-up are available for an additional charge of $10.00 per 30 minutes. Our Lunch Hour is Noon-1:00 PM.\u003c/p>\u003cp data-cms-target=\"cms-450\">Campers in both the All-day and Half-day camps are welcome to join us for lunch.\u003c/p>\u003c/div>\u003c/section>\n\u003csection class=\"section-shell summer-registration\" data-cms-target=\"cms-492\">\u003ca class=\"button button-dark\" href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/register/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-454\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Register Now \u003c/span>\u003cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">↗\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003c/section>\u003csection class=\"section-shell summer-contact\" data-cms-target=\"cms-493\">\u003ch2 data-cms-target=\"cms-451\">Interested in Learning More?\u003c/h2>\u003ca class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/contact/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-455\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Contact Us \u003c/span>\u003cspan aria-hidden=\"true\">↗\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003c/section>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"section-shell cms-extra-sections\" data-cms-target=\"cms-494\">\u003c/div>\u003c/main>\n\u003cfooter class=\"site-footer\">\u003cdiv class=\"footer-top\">\u003ca class=\"footer-brand\" href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-434\">Dance Institute\u003c/a>\u003ca class=\"back-top\" href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/summer-intensive/index.html#main\" aria-label=\"Back to top\" data-cms-target=\"cms-486\">↑\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"footer-grid\">\u003cdiv>\u003ca href=\"tel:+13035250011\" data-cms-target=\"cms-436\">\u003cspan class=\"cms-phone-number\">303-525-0011\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"cms-phone-suffix\">Call or Text\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"mailto:dance@danceinstitutedenver.com\" data-cms-target=\"cms-437\">dance@danceinstitutedenver.com\u003c/a>\u003c/div>\u003caddress>\u003ca href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=10515+E+40th+Ave+%23114+Denver+CO+80239\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cms-target=\"cms-438\">10515 E 40th Ave\u003cbr>#114\u003cbr>Denver, CO 80239\u003c/a>\u003c/address>\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"footer-bottom\">\u003cdiv>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/privacy-policy/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-482\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Privacy Policy\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003ca href=\"https://dance-institute-denver-design.gnotobiot.chatgpt.site/accessibility-statement/index.html\" data-cms-target=\"cms-483\">\u003cspan data-cms-label=\"\">Accessibility Statement\u003c/span>\u003c/a>\u003c/div